        "sourcePath": "documentation/Accelerate/sparsesolve-34okt.md",
        "id": "seg:paragraph:see-also:0013:0001",
        "ko": "Solves the system `AX=B` for `X`, using the supplied `SparseOpaqueFactorization_Complex_Double` of `A`, in place."
      },
